# ===== The Veil, task 2 (fix round 1): Mirror Image upcast - 2 Doubles at slot 3+, 3 at slot 5+ =====
# APPLY ONLY IN TASK 6, AFTER `gen_upcast_variants.pl --apply` has regenerated the variants from the level-1 root
# (20_doubles.patch): only then do Target_Arcana_Card_Spell_MirrorImage_2 .. _6 exist. `_2` keeps the root's single
# Summon (it inherits SpellProperties through `using`), so it gets no line here.
# Today only _5 and _6 exist (from the old level-4 root), so a dry run now stops at the first `@set ..._3`
# ("@set: ... nao existe"): this patch cannot be dry-run before Task 6's generator run.
#
# How several Doubles: repeat Summon in SpellProperties, the vanilla way (Projectile_SpiderlingSpawning repeats
# GROUND:Summon(...) once per spiderling). Each Summon applies DOUBLE_OF_THE_VEIL_TECH, so each Double
# fires its own StatusApplied and registers / checks the cap on its own in ARCANA_Deceiver_Doubles.txt.
# SpellProperties is not one of the generator's own fields (%OWN_TXT / %OWN_STATS), so it survives later reruns.

@set Target_Arcana_Card_Spell_MirrorImage_3 SpellProperties GROUND:Summon(8807d230-d0f5-4aa5-b6e4-4b36e9da2ec8,-1,,,,DOUBLE_OF_THE_VEIL_TECH);GROUND:Summon(8807d230-d0f5-4aa5-b6e4-4b36e9da2ec8,-1,,,,DOUBLE_OF_THE_VEIL_TECH);
